    {
      "id": "claim_5108acb88bd64393aa58b448aba077ba",
      "statement": "The backend defines assistant-domain topology in `app.modules.domains`: `public.py` re-exports `DOMAIN_KINDS`, `DomainSpec`, `domain_spec`, and `domain_specs`, and the internal catalog separates a static boot-safe kind map from lazily tenant-resolved domain specs so composition roots can share one catalog without reading tenant config at startup.",
