      "id": "claim_8c56fd3b9a7b4fc383e73a54ab62d945",
      "statement": "`mount_domains(app)` in `app/registry.py` is a single dispatch loop over `DOMAIN_KINDS` that mounts live domain endpoints by kind: grounded domains via `_mount_grounded`, workflow via `_mount_helpdesk`, tool via `_mount_builder` or `_mount_platform`, graph via `_mount_graph`, and then mounts `/flow` separately because it is a runtime surface rather than a catalog domain.",
